{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.BraidKnot.BoxContent","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.BoxContent","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Data.Int.Basic","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic.Ring","lean:module:QOU.MathlibExt.YoungDiagramCells"],"declarations":17,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.row_two_contents_are_weights","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.row_two_contents_are_weights","kind":"theorem","line":120,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/BoxContent.lean#L120-L127","doc":"`λ = (2)` is the one shape on which every content is a weight: contents\n`0, 1` inside the spin-1 weights `−1, 0, 1`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.column_content_not_weight","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.column_content_not_weight","kind":"theorem","line":112,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/BoxContent.lean#L112-L118","doc":"`λ = (1,1)`: the lower box has content `−1`, but `V_{(1,1)}` is the\ntrivial representation with the single weight `0`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.single_box_content_not_weight","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.single_box_content_not_weight","kind":"theorem","line":104,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/BoxContent.lean#L104-L110","doc":"`λ = (1)`: the single box has content `0`, but `V_{(1)}` has spin `1/2`\nand its weights are `±1/2`; `0` fails by parity. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.top_content_not_weight","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.top_content_not_weight","kind":"theorem","line":95,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/BoxContent.lean#L95-L102","doc":"The rightmost cell of the first row, `(0, a−1)`, has content `a − 1`; for\n`3 ≤ a + b` twice that exceeds `2j = a − b`, so it is not a weight of\n`V_{(a,b)}` — under any assignment of boxes to weight spaces. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.twoRow_card_cells_ne_card_weights","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.twoRow_card_cells_ne_card_weights","kind":"theorem","line":86,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/BoxContent.lean#L86-L93","doc":"Number of cells of `(a, b)` versus number of weights of `V_{(a,b)}`:\n`a + b ≠ (a − b) + 1`, always. There is no bijection \"box ↔ weight space\"\nfor any two-row shape, so \"the corresponding weight space\" of a box is\nnot defined. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.IsTwoRowWeight","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.IsTwoRowWeight","kind":"def","line":80,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/BoxContent.lean#L80-L84","doc":"`m2` is twice a weight of `V_{(a,b)}`: `|m2| ≤ 2j` and `m2 ≡ 2j (mod 2)`.\nStated without `abs` so that `omega` can discharge every instance. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.twoRowTwiceSpin","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.twoRowTwiceSpin","kind":"def","line":77,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/BoxContent.lean#L77-L78","doc":"Twice the spin of `V_λ` for the two-row shape `λ = (a, b)`: `2j = a − b`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.boxContent_eq_content","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.boxContent_eq_content","kind":"theorem","line":71,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/BoxContent.lean#L71-L73","doc":"`boxContent` is the canonical cell content (`qou-cdup` single home). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.boxContent","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.boxContent","kind":"def","line":63,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/BoxContent.lean#L63-L69","doc":"The content `c = j - i` of a box at position `(i,j)` in a Young diagram.\n\nThis is the q-Jucys–Murphy eigenvalue datum of the box. It is **not** the\nmagnetic quantum number of an `SU_q(2)` weight space — see the module\nheader and `top_content_not_weight` below. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.instReprCell","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.instReprCell","kind":"instance","line":61,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/BoxContent.lean#L61-L61","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.instReprCell.repr","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.instReprCell.repr","kind":"def","line":61,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/BoxContent.lean#L61-L61","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.instDecidableEqCell","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.instDecidableEqCell","kind":"instance","line":61,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/BoxContent.lean#L61-L61","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.instDecidableEqCell.decEq","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.instDecidableEqCell.decEq","kind":"def","line":61,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/BoxContent.lean#L61-L61","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.Cell.col","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.Cell.col","kind":"def","line":60,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/BoxContent.lean#L60-L60","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.Cell.row","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.Cell.row","kind":"def","line":59,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/BoxContent.lean#L59-L59","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.Cell.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.Cell.mk","kind":"ctor","line":58,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/BoxContent.lean#L58-L58","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.Cell","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.Cell","kind":"structure","line":57,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/BoxContent.lean#L57-L61","doc":"A cell in a Young diagram, parameterized by `(row, col)` (0-indexed). ","signatureChunk":0}]}